Z||000000||Tabs31||11-18-2001||03:49 PM||||I was just looking at a website that sells altezza lights for different model cars and wondering why they haven't made altezza lights for the notchback and fastback fieros out there.<P>I think they would really look good??<BR>Does anybody have any friends in high places that can get this done???<P>Heres a pic for people who don't know what altezza style lights are <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/alltezza_1.jpg"> <P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/tabs31_1.jpg"> ||||reg||1
