Z||000004||Seanh||11-18-2001||04:49 PM||||  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Spektrum-87GT:<BR><B>lucky for us... we have better<BR> <A HREF="http://www.thefibersmith.com" TARGET=_blank>www.thefibersmith.com</A> <P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>I like those, but there just not the look I'm going for...They are really nice, but I want a more modern look for the car, and altezza's are pretty much the newest thing available...<P>Be prepared, I'm sure us and this thread will get gutted by the anti-rice followers...Just because Ricers use them doesn't mean it's rice...<BR>------------------<BR>Sean Heberly - 86 GT<BR>Back to my 3.1L...<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Image2.gif">  <p>[This message has been edited by Seanh (edited 11-18-2001).]||||reg||1
