Z||000006||Jaei Sun||11-18-2001||05:42 PM||||That is RICE!  RICE RICE RICE.<P>J/K<P>I got an extra GT housing that I'm working on to convert to "alteeza style.  I'm using fiberglass and I'm still looking for the red lenes that are used on the real alteeza's  maybe I can contact a company who manufactres them and tell them I need to replace my lenses on say an Integra and I just need to order the lenses parts.?  I don't know.<P>------------------<BR>       <IMG SRC="http://home.mn.rr.com/fierojaei/Jaei_blue.gif"> ||||reg||1
Z||000007||MinnGreenGT||11-19-2001||01:13 PM||||Here is the thread about my clear taillights... not exactly Altezza, but still "ricish" for the critics!<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/GTfin02.jpg"> <BR> <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/011212.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/011212.html</A> <P>I spoke with some manufacturers while working on mine- problem with doing something along those lines is startup production cost.  A set of molds for something like that easily runs $1-$5 grand depending on complexity (and the altezza design is not simplistic).<P>------------------<BR>              <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/GreenGT6.gif"> ||||reg||1
